    "objects": {
      "general": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Key insights (full year)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Very long stays: stays of 15+ days are 11% of admissions but 35% of bed-days; 17 of them are colds, flu, allergy or migraine.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Severity does not predict stay: high 6.3 days vs low 5.88 (p = 0.91); a common cold (7.74 d) stays longer than a stroke (7.45 d).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Age is the one real driver: children 4.7 days, seniors 7.1; seniors are 36% of admissions and 41% of bed-days.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Billing: only 21% of admissions have a genuine bill (the rest are 999/3852 placeholders); none of the 28 longest stays is billed.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Demand: May is busiest (32 admissions, peak census 13 on 16 May), August quietest (10); admissions cluster Tuesday-Wednesday and drop on Friday.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "- Doctors: Dr. Reem Abdullah and Dr. Mohamed Hassan treat 34% of patients but use 39% of bed-days (not statistically conclusive, p = 0.30).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Recommendations",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "1. Fix billing capture: make a real bill mandatory at discharge and block the 999/3852 defaults (target: 100% completeness).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "2. Weekly review of every patient past day 7, starting with the 17 minor-condition stays of 15+ days (about 250 bed-days, 16% of the year).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "3. Audit severity coding against clear triage criteria (sample of stroke and pneumonia records).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "4. Flexible capacity for the May / October peaks (13 and 9 beds vs an average of about 4); roster for Tuesday-Wednesday intake; geriatric discharge support.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "5. Add a unique patient ID and date validation to the admission form (12% of records had reversed dates; readmissions cannot be tracked).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "12pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
